est expecting `round_money(Decimal(\"2.665\"))` to give `2.66` failed.\n- **Fix:** On branch `fix/money-half-even-rounding` (commit `08d3cd5986`), I changed `round_money` to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Nothing else changed.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101. The first response showed no reviewers attached, so I requested alex separately and that went through.\n\nThis changes how exact half-cent amounts round: 2.665 now rounds to 2.66 instead of 2.67. I noted this in the PR description. I couldn't look up FIN-212 because the advisory lookup said it doesn't exist, so the change is based only on the test and the code's own description.\n\nI haven't merged the PR. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner.", "type": "text"}]}]}